The local ULDC change also accepts indexed unsigned byte/halfword loads through Maxwell LDC, with the existing offset and operand guards retained.
The local register-pressure table includes immediate FMNMX, P2R and indexed LDC so high guest registers are preserved for those already-supported instructions.
